语法

    0 $accept: Program $end

    1 Program: ExtDefList

    2 ExtDefList: ExtDef ExtDefList
    3           | %empty

    4 ExtDef: Specifier ExtDecList SEMI
    5       | Specifier SEMI
    6       | Specifier FunDec CompSt
    7       | error SEMI

    8 Specifier: TYPE
    9          | StructSpecifier

   10 StructSpecifier: STRUCT OptTag LC DefList RC
   11                | STRUCT Tag
   12                | STRUCT OptTag LC error RC

   13 OptTag: ID
   14       | %empty

   15 Tag: ID

   16 ExtDecList: VarDec
   17           | VarDec COMMA ExtDecList

   18 VarDec: ID
   19       | VarDec LB INT RB

   20 FunDec: ID LP VarList RP
   21       | ID LP RP

   22 VarList: ParamDec COMMA VarList
   23        | ParamDec

   24 ParamDec: Specifier VarDec

   25 CompSt: LC DefList StmtList RC

   26 DefList: Def DefList
   27        | %empty

   28 Def: Specifier DecList SEMI
   29    | Specifier error SEMI

   30 DecList: Dec
   31        | Dec COMMA DecList

   32 Dec: VarDec
   33    | VarDec ASSIGNOP Exp

   34 StmtList: Stmt StmtList
   35         | %empty

   36 Stmt: Exp SEMI
   37     | CompSt
   38     | RETURN Exp SEMI
   39     | IF LP Exp RP Stmt
   40     | IF LP Exp RP Stmt ELSE Stmt
   41     | WHILE LP Exp RP Stmt
   42     | error SEMI
   43     | error RC
   44     | WHILE LP error RP Stmt
   45     | IF LP error RP Stmt
   46     | IF LP error RP Stmt ELSE Stmt

   47 Exp: Exp ASSIGNOP Exp
   48    | Exp AND Exp
   49    | Exp OR Exp
   50    | Exp RELOP Exp
   51    | Exp PLUS Exp
   52    | Exp MINUS Exp
   53    | Exp STAR Exp
   54    | Exp DIV Exp
   55    | LP Exp RP
   56    | MINUS Exp
   57    | NOT Exp
   58    | ID LP Args RP
   59    | ID LP RP
   60    | Exp LB Exp RB
   61    | Exp DOT ID
   62    | ID
   63    | INT
   64    | FLOAT

   65 Args: Exp COMMA Args
   66     | Exp


